<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Graphics on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/categories/graphics/</link><description>Recent content in Graphics on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 21:07:07 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/categories/graphics/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>python Pygame Fireworks Animation: Particles, Gravity, Trails and Bursts</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pypyfianpa.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 21:07:07 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pypyfianpa.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;With only a few hours left before 2023, I wrote a small Pygame fireworks animation to celebrate.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Install Pygame first:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;python -m pip install pygame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The animation launches a particle upward under gravity. When its vertical velocity becomes non-negative, it explodes into many colored particles. Each particle decelerates, falls, and leaves a short trail.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabinde